dimensions and the number of elements in :attr:`input`.

Args:
    input (Tensor): the tensor to be reshaped
    shape (tuple of int): the new shape

Example::

    >>> a = torch.arange(4.)
    >>> torch.reshape(a, (2, 2))
    tensor([[ 0.,  1.],
            [ 2.,  3.]])
    >>> b = torch.tensor([[0, 1], [2, 3]])
    >>> torch.reshape(b, (-1,))
    tensor([ 0,  1,  2,  3])

